## Ported from Libraries/LibWeb/ARIA/ARIAMixin.cpp:249 Web::ARIA::ARIAMixin::aria_active_descendant_element
## (ENUMERATE_ARIA_ELEMENT_REFERENCING_ATTRIBUTES).
pub func aria_mixin_aria_active_descendant_element(this: AriaMixin*) -> DomElement*?:
